Description: Cherry Cherry Square Wave, 4k intro by FCCCF (Instanssi 2019)
 Cherry Cherry Square Wave is a Linux 4k intro coded by muffintrap of
 Funny Curly Cat Code Factory (FCCCF), released at Instanssi 2019 where it
 ranked 4th in the combined intro compo.
 .
 Flowers drawn with OpenGL immediate mode, on a raw square wave
 soundtrack. Please enjoy the pretty flowers.
 .
 The intro is only available as a precompiled x86-64 binary, linked to
 SDL 1.2 and OpenGL. The package installs the "fixed audio" version.
